u}\! \left((Q \otimes I_\mathbf{v}) Xight) = \operatorname{\mathcal{E}}_{
u}\! \left((Q \otimes I_\mathbf{v}) Xight) = (Q \otimes I_\mathbf{v}) \operatorname{\mathcal{E}}_{
